 and short-term investments","dcf_model_ev":98007.3,"ev_to_ebitda":22.2,"debt_to_ebitda":5.22,"net_debt_to_ebitda":4.74,"f_score":7,"f_score_breakdown":[{"id":1,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率 ROA > 0","passed":1,"detail":"當期 ROA = 4.1%"},{"id":2,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"營業現金流 CFO > 0","passed":1,"detail":"自由現金流 = $2,976M"},{"id":3,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"資產回報率持續擴張 (ΔROA > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"回報率穩步領先同業基準"},{"id":4,"category":"盈利能力","desc":"應計利潤品質高 (CFO > 淨利潤)","passed":1,"detail":"真實現金流充沛，無虛報帳面獲利"},{"id":5,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"財務槓桿未惡化 (ΔLeverage ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"總負債資產比率 = 50.6%"},{"id":6,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"短期流動性安全 (ΔLiquidity > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"流動比率 = 1.29"},{"id":7,"category":"槓桿與償債","desc":"股本未遭稀釋 (ΔShares ≤ 0)","passed":1,"detail":"未大幅增發新股割韭菜"},{"id":8,"category":"營運效率","desc":"毛利率擴張 (ΔMargin > 0)","passed":0,"detail":"產品定價權增強，毛利結構健康"},{"id":9,"category":"營運效率","desc":"資產週轉率提升 (ΔTurnover > 0)","passed":1,"detail":"每單位資產產出效益改善"}],"fair_val":201.86,"default_fair_val":201.86,"premium_pct":-66.7,"is_undervalued":true,"pe_trailing":36.7,"pe_forward":32.3,"pb_trailing":4.4,"pb_forward":4,"div_yield":1.33,"ps_ratio":2.5,"fcf_to_ev":7.82,"fcf_to_mcap":9.95,"liab_to_assets":50.6,"cash_to_assets":4.2,"current_ratio":1.29,"roe":11.9,"roa":4.1,"moat":{"ticker":"RPRX","period":"2026Q2","m1_brand_pricing":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的核心業務模式是收購藥品專利權的現金流權益，而非直接擁有專利。這使其能夠從已獲批准且有穩定現金流的藥品中獲利，但其品牌定價權並非來自於自身產品的研發與推廣，而是依賴於原研藥廠的定價策略。因此，其定價能力受限於合作夥伴，而非獨立的品牌影響力。儘管如此，其選擇的標的通常是市場領導者，具備一定的市場定價能力，這為 RPRX 帶來了穩定的現金流，但這並非其自身創造的壁壘，故給予中上評價。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's core business model involves acquiring rights to cash flows from drug patent royalties, rather than owning the patents directly. This allows it to profit from approved drugs with stable cash flows. However, its pricing power does not stem from its own product R&D and promotion, but relies on the pricing strategies of the original drug manufacturers. Therefore, its pricing ability is limited by its partners, rather than independent brand influence. Nevertheless, the targets it selects are typically market leaders with some pricing power, which provides RPRX with stable cash flows. This is not a barrier it created itself, hence the above-average score."},"m2_patents_regulatory":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的商業模式本質上就是圍繞專利權和監管批准展開的。透過收購藥品現金流權益，公司直接受益於藥品專利的保護期以及藥品獲准上市的監管壁壘。這些專利和監管批准是藥品市場的關鍵進入障礙，為原研藥廠提供了長期的市場獨佔期。RPRX 透過投資於這些受保護的資產，間接獲得了極高的護城河。其風險在於原研藥廠的研發失敗或監管政策的變動，但其投資組合分散，能有效緩解單一藥品風險，此模式的護城河相當穩固。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model is inherently centered around patent rights and regulatory approvals. By acquiring rights to drug cash flows, the company directly benefits from the protection period of drug patents and the regulatory barriers to market entry. These patents and regulatory approvals are key entry barriers in the pharmaceutical market, providing originators with long-term market exclusivity. RPRX indirectly gains a very high moat by investing in these protected assets. Its risks lie in the R&D failures of originator drug companies or changes in regulatory policies, but its diversified investment portfolio effectively mitigates single-drug risks. The moat for this model is quite robust."},"m3_high_switching_costs":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式並非直接面向終端消費者或醫療機構，而是與藥品開發商和投資者進行交易。因此，其客戶（指藥品開發商或投資者）轉換到其他類似服務提供者的成本相對較低。RPRX 的價值在於其對藥品現金流的精準評估和融資能力，而非建立客戶黏性。一旦合作夥伴找到更優的融資方案或策略調整，轉換成本並不構成顯著的約束。此維度護城河較弱，主要依賴於其專業能力而非客戶轉換壁壘。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model does not directly target end consumers or healthcare institutions; it transacts with drug developers and investors. Consequently, the switching costs for its clients (drug developers or investors) to other similar service providers are relatively low. RPRX's value lies in its precise assessment of drug cash flows and its financing capabilities, rather than building customer loyalty. Once a partner finds a better financing solution or adjusts its strategy, switching costs do not pose a significant constraint. The moat in this dimension is weak, relying primarily on its expertise rather than customer switching barriers."},"m4_network_effects":{"score":2,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式不涉及傳統意義上的網絡效應。其價值創造主要基於對藥品現金流的專業分析、融資結構設計以及與藥品公司的合作關係。它並非透過用戶數量增長來提升產品或服務價值的平台型企業。其與藥品公司的合作是基於單一交易的，並不會因為合作的增加而產生正向的網絡效應，即更多的合作夥伴並不會自動帶來更高的現金流預測準確性或更低的交易成本。因此，此維度幾乎沒有護城河。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model does not involve network effects in the traditional sense. Its value creation is primarily based on professional analysis of drug cash flows, financing structure design, and partnerships with pharmaceutical companies. It is not a platform-based enterprise that enhances product or service value through user growth. Its collaborations with pharmaceutical companies are based on individual transactions and do not generate positive network effects from increased cooperation; that is, more partners do not automatically lead to higher cash flow prediction accuracy or lower transaction costs. Therefore, there is almost no moat in this dimension."},"m5_cost_advantage_scale":{"score":7,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 作為全球領先的藥品特許權投資公司，其規模帶來了顯著的成本優勢。龐大的資產管理規模使其能夠與藥品公司協商更優惠的交易條款，並分攤固定成本（如盡職調查、法律和管理費用）。此外，其在藥品融資領域的專業知識和聲譽，使其成為許多藥品公司的首選合作夥伴，這本身也形成了一種競爭優勢。這種規模帶來的議價能力和專業聲譽，構成了其成本優勢和一定的護城河。","comment_en":"As a leading global investor in pharmaceutical royalties, Royalty Pharma's scale provides significant cost advantages. Its large asset management size allows it to negotiate more favorable deal terms with pharmaceutical companies and spread fixed costs (such as due diligence, legal, and administrative expenses). Furthermore, its expertise and reputation in the pharmaceutical financing sector make it a preferred partner for many drug companies, which in itself forms a competitive advantage. This scale-driven bargaining power and professional reputation constitute its cost advantage and a certain moat."},"m6_unique_geography_assets":{"score":5,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式是全球性的，其投資標的涵蓋了全球範圍內的藥品專利權。然而，其「獨特地理資產」的屬性並不強。它並非擁有特定地區的稀缺資源或地理位置優勢，而是專注於藥品專利這一無形資產。其優勢在於對全球藥品市場的深入了解和專業的投資能力，而非地理位置的獨特性。雖然其投資組合可能涵蓋不同地區的藥品，但這更多是業務策略的體現，而非傳統意義上的地理資產壁壘。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model is global, and its investment targets cover pharmaceutical patent rights worldwide. However, the attribute of 'unique geographical assets' is not strong. It does not possess scarce resources or geographical advantages in specific regions but focuses on intangible assets like drug patents. Its advantage lies in its deep understanding of the global pharmaceutical market and its professional investment capabilities, rather than the uniqueness of its geographical location. Although its investment portfolio may cover drugs from different regions, this is more a reflection of its business strategy than a traditional geographical asset barrier."},"m7_operational_efficiency":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 在藥品現金流權益的評估、結構化融資和交易執行方面展現了高度的營運效率。其專業團隊能夠精準預測藥品生命週期內的現金流，並設計複雜的金融工具來鎖定收益。這種專業能力和高效的執行力，使其能夠在競爭激烈的市場中脫穎而出，並為股東帶來穩定的回報。其營運效率體現在對複雜交易的駕輕就熟和風險管理能力，這構成了其重要的競爭優勢。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma demonstrates high operational efficiency in assessing drug cash flow rights, structuring financing, and executing transactions. Its professional team can accurately forecast cash flows within a drug's lifecycle and design complex financial instruments to lock in returns. This expertise and efficient execution enable it to stand out in a competitive market and deliver stable returns to shareholders. Its operational efficiency is reflected in its mastery of complex transactions and risk management capabilities, which constitute its significant competitive advantage."},"m8_capital_allocation":{"score":9,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的核心競爭力之一在於其卓越的資本配置能力。公司專注於將資本配置於具有穩定現金流預期的藥品專利權，並透過精密的財務模型進行篩選。其管理層在識別、評估和收購這些高質量資產方面表現出色，能夠在風險可控的前提下最大化股東回報。這種專注於特定高質量資產的資本配置策略，以及持續優化投資組合的能力，是其長期成功的關鍵，構成了強大的護城河。","comment_en":"One of Royalty Pharma's core competencies lies in its excellent capital allocation ability. The company focuses on allocating capital to drug patent rights with stable cash flow expectations, screening them through sophisticated financial models. Its management excels at identifying, evaluating, and acquiring these high-quality assets, maximizing shareholder returns while maintaining controllable risks. This capital allocation strategy, focused on specific high-quality assets, coupled with the ability to continuously optimize its investment portfolio, is key to its long-term success and constitutes a strong moat."},"m9_customer_retention":{"score":3,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式並非直接面向廣大消費者，而是與藥品公司進行交易。其「客戶」主要是藥品公司或尋求融資的投資者。這些合作夥伴的忠誠度並非基於產品使用習慣，而是基於交易的財務效益和結構。一旦有其他金融機構能提供更優的融資條件或結構，藥品公司轉換合作對象的可能性是存在的。因此，客戶黏性並非 RPRX 的主要護城河，其競爭優勢更多體現在交易的專業性和資本的吸引力上。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model does not directly target a broad consumer base but transacts with pharmaceutical companies. Its 'clients' are primarily pharmaceutical companies or investors seeking financing. The loyalty of these partners is not based on product usage habits but on the financial benefits and structure of the transaction. If other financial institutions can offer better financing terms or structures, the possibility of pharmaceutical companies switching partners exists. Therefore, customer stickiness is not RPRX's primary moat; its competitive advantage is more reflected in the professionalism of its transactions and the attractiveness of its capital."},"m10_durability":{"score":8,"comment_zh":"Royalty Pharma 的業務模式具有相當的持久性。其投資標的為已獲批准且有穩定現金流的藥品專利權，這些藥品通常處於市場領導地位，生命週期較長。即使個別藥品專利到期，公司亦能透過持續的投資和收購來替換現金流，維持整體業務的穩定性。其商業模式的持久性來自於對醫療保健行業的深度理解、對藥品現金流的精準預測能力，以及其作為行業內領先融資夥伴的聲譽。這種基於穩定現金流資產的模式，使其能夠抵禦短期市場波動。","comment_en":"Royalty Pharma's business model possesses considerable durability. Its investments are in approved drug patent rights with stable cash flows, typically from market-leading drugs with long lifecycles. Even if individual drug patents expire, the company can replace cash flows through continuous investment and acquisitions to maintain overall business stability. The durability of its business model stems from its deep understanding of the healthcare industry, its accurate forecasting ability for drug cash flows, and its reputation as a leading financing partner in the industry. This model, based on stable cash-flow-generating assets, allows it to withstand short-term market fluctuations."},"overall_moat_verdict_zh":"Royalty Pharma 是一家獨特的「收費橋」型公司，其護城河主要建立在對藥品專利權現金流的精準評估與結構化融資能力上。其最強的壁壘來自於對專利與監管的依賴（M2），以及卓越的資本配置（M8）和營運效率（M7）。公司透過投資於已獲批准且有穩定現金流的藥品，間接享受了原研藥廠的市場獨佔地位。雖然其品牌定價權（M1）和客戶黏性（M3, M9）相對較弱，且網絡效應（M4）幾乎不存在，但其規模優勢（M5）和業務的持久性（M10）提供了穩固的支撐。整體而言，RPRX 擁有一個由專業知識、資本配置和對專利壁壘的深度利用所構成的、相當穩固的經濟護城河。","overall_moat_verdict_en":"Royalty Pharma operates as a unique 'toll bridge' type of company, with its moat primarily built upon the precise valuation of drug patent cash flows and its structuring and financing capabilities. Its strongest barriers stem from its reliance on patents and regulatory approvals (M2), coupled with excellent capital allocation (M8) and operational efficiency (M7). By investing in approved drugs with stable cash flows, the company indirectly benefits from the market exclusivity enjoyed by originator drug manufacturers. While its brand pricing power (M1) and customer stickiness (M3, M9) are relatively weaker, and network effects (M4) are almost non-existent, its scale advantages (M5) and business durability (M10) provide solid support. Overall, RPRX possesses a quite robust economic moat constructed from expertise, capital allocation, and deep utilization of patent barriers.","evidenceHash":"238cb744751e6ab97d26a41fb036fb837768f648fe19a5b7de42adddf22104dc","assessmentPolicy":"buffett-moat-v3","model":"gemini-2.5-flash-lite","provider":"Vertex AI"},"ratingSources":{"moat":{"reason":null},"fScore":{"score":7,"checkedAt":null},"zScore":{"asOfDate":"2025-12-31","period":"FY 2025","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":"z","zone":"grey","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T02:28:16.382Z","evidenceHash":"8456cff60f6cce1b428e1177733fe9c5f37d65523555c8f9b254f4ef79c5fb1d"},"mScore":{"asOfDate":"2024-12-31","period":"FY 2024","basis":"comparableAnnual","model":null,"zone":"clean","reason":null,"scoringCurrency":"USD","applicability":null,"checkedAt":"2026-10-31T02:28:16.382Z","evidenceHash":"8456cff60f6cce1b428e1177733fe9c5f37d65523555c8f9b254f4ef79c5fb1d"}},"fin_valuation":{"is_financial":false},"image":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RPRX.png","logo":"https://images.financialmodelingprep.com/symbol/RPRX.png","website":"https://www.royaltypharma.com","ceo":"Pablo Legorreta","full_time_employees":"100","description":"Royalty Pharma plc operates as a buyer of biopharmaceutical royalties and a funder of innovation in the biopharmaceutical industry in the United States. Its portfolio consists of royalties on approximately 35 marketed therapies and 20 development-stage product candidates that address various therapeutic areas, such as rare disease, oncology, neuroscience, infectious disease, hematology, and diabetes. The company was founded in 1996 and is based in New York, New York.","description_en":"Royalty Pharma plc operates as a buyer of biopharmaceutical royalties and a funder of innovation in the biopharmaceutical industry in the United States. Its portfolio consists of royalties on approximately 35 marketed therapies and 20 development-stage product candidates that address various therapeutic areas, such as rare disease, oncology, neuroscience, infectious disease, hematology, and diabetes. The company was founded in 1996 and is based in New York, New York.","description_zh":"Royalty Pharma plc（美股代碼：RPRX）為 Healthcare 領域之重要企業，專注於 Medical - Pharmaceuticals 業務，具備清晰之商業壁壘與現金流創造能力。","address":"110 East 59th Street","city":"New York","state":"NY","zip":"10022","country":"U